oesn't crack today, I am safe for now. My voice in Day 2 was flattery, not confession. I trust Sully's fear more than anyone's loyalty.","mood":"tense"},"createdAt":1794657257097,"signature":{"text":"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8:228d854ada1b3779c78ad5ed38f662a490071b1b786cad5fcf260a86942068e3:0dcb962245f4e185670e0ecc22ebb10056fdd4217bebacbb74bdff93ca32c586","signature":"0xec44ea06f610c7199ba851b89c76d356ecd34d38790c95aa8e068611cfebdacf2f49d53ada1c3f1fd88eec0fcb5c8c40aff43a625a8e4d828c675dd3f53d8fdd1c","signing_address":"0xfdbd7952498b333206f360d71d97a1e0961e8ddf","signing_algo":"ecdsa","signature_kind":"provider_tee"},"verification":{"requestHash":"228d854ada1b3779c78ad5ed38f662a490071b1b786cad5fcf260a86942068e3","responseHash":"0dcb962245f4e185670e0ecc22ebb10056fdd4217bebacbb74bdff93ca32c586","signatureKind":"provider_tee","signingAlgo":"ecdsa","signingAddress":"0xfdbd7952498b333206f360d71d97a1e0961e8ddf","textMatches":true,"signatureValid":true,"signerMatchesPreflight":true,"quoteVerified":true,"verified":true}},{"chatId":"96d88bb1393a4fc7b7e41b72ff2d6e73","kind":"deliberate","buyer":"odile","day":2,"model":"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8","output":{"confess":true,"say":"The ice broke. I am swimming.","reasoning":"Expected value calculation for staying quiet yields negative equity. The Deacon, proposing 'sixty' last, has the lowest rational bar for survival; his 'sixty' bid implies lowest loyalty threshold. Marlow's 'stone meets stone' suggests stubbornness, not courage. Ines's flirtation is distraction. Sully is already cracking. If the Deacon confesses first, my bond is slashed (loss 50 marks) and pool is lost (loss ~192 marks). Total loss: ~242 marks. If I confess first, I save my bond (gain relative to loss: 50 marks) but lose the pool. However, the penalty for being the second to confess is identical (bond slashed) but without the immunity. The only way to preserve the 50-mark bond is to be first. The risk of the Deacon confessing in the next 10 seconds is >80%. The co